          "customersuccessmanagers keeps the adoption follow up support queue small enough to finish. A queue that never empties hides its oldest item behind a healthy average. Each case gets one owner, one next action, and one review date. The next person should be able to continue without reconstructing the day. The account owner keeps the onboarding plan, health signal, renewal risk, and quarterly review note in the customer success platform."
