        "paragraphs": [
          "Verification for adoption follow up support means checking that the adoption follow up support record links the source, the decision, and the approved close. A sent reminder or a closed ticket proves activity, not outcome. customersuccessmanagers reviews a small sample against the same definition each month. The sample should include one difficult case, not only the easy queue. The account owner keeps the onboarding plan, health signal, renewal risk, and quarterly review note in the customer success platform.",
          "The review ends with one decision. Fix the source, simplify the field, change the queue, or stop the work until the accountable owner decides. customersuccessmanagers gives each change an owner and a check date. That is how a adoption follow up support control improves instead of becoming another status meeting. The account owner keeps the onboarding plan, health signal, renewal risk, and quarterly review note in the customer success platform."
        ]
