          "The weekly handoff for adoption follow up support belongs with the record, not in a private message. Name what moved, what stalled, and who owns the next check. customersuccessmanagers asks the specialist to date the handoff and link it to the open case. A Monday reviewer should be able to continue without an interview. The account owner keeps the onboarding plan, health signal, renewal risk, and quarterly review note in the customer success platform.",
