          "The monthly review should end with one process change and one owner. customersuccessmanagers does not accept a review that ends with general encouragement. The team fixes the form, the source, or the queue rule, then checks the same measure next month. That rhythm turns adoption follow up support from a recurring complaint into a managed control. The account owner keeps the onboarding plan, health signal, renewal risk, and quarterly review note in the customer success platform."
